<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guerra de Reinos - Acceso</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Georgia, serif; background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #f0f0f0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
        .login-box { background: #2c3e50; padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); width: 350px; text-align: center; border: 2px solid #f39c12; }
        h1 { color: #f39c12; margin-top: 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        p { color: #bdc3c7; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        input { width: 100%; padding: 12px; margin: 8px 0; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #7f8c8d; border-radius: 5px; background: #34495e; color: white; }
        button { width: 100%; padding: 12px; margin-top: 10px; background: #f39c12; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
        button:hover { background: #d35400; }
        .error { color: #e74c3c; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 14px; }
        a { color: #3498db; text-decoration: none; display: block; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-box">
        <h1>Guerra de Reinos</h1>
        <p>El continente te espera. ¿Estás listo para conquistar?</p>
        
        <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="/entrar" method="POST">
            <input type="text" name="usuario" placeholder="Introduce tu nombre de Rey" required>
            <button type="submit">Entrar al Reino</button>
        </form>
        <a href="/registrar-map">Primera vez aquí? Generar Mapa</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
